 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. Um. I want to catch up on my vaccinations. I moved here for university and my records are missing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's common. Before we plan anything, how are you today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit of a cold. Mild."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me more."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A dry cough, since two days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Runny nose?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, a bit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sore throat?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little, in the mornings."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations or procedures?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hernia repair, in 2018."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any illnesses in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father has diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And you're a student?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Engineering."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take your numbers. Pulse 76, blood pressure 118 over 72, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14, weight 70 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it okay to get vaccines with a cold? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A mild cold, no fever, is no reason to delay. Any problem with your breathing?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, just the cough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I think this looks like a mild cold, but I can't rule out early flu."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Flu? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Unlikely without fever. If a fever develops, we'll postpone. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "For the records, I'll request your old vaccination history from your home country's clinic. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother can send photos. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Even better. Send them to the surgery."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Today. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Once we have them, we'll work out what's missing and book it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Next week. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If your arm becomes very red, hot, or swollen after any jab, come back and see me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Rest, fluids, and wash your hands often."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. ~"
  }
